, meeting the working requirements under day and night and all-weather conditions.</li><li>Supports intelligent functions such as hotspot alarm, target detection, tracking, and device PHM health management.</li><li>Integrated design of detection and warning, integrating detection module and warning module.</li><li>Quasi-spherical structure design, better wind resistance and anti-shake performance, clearer imaging.</li><li>Flexible deployment, simple operation, stable and reliable, easy to maintain.</li></ul>"}]}]}],["$","section",null,{"id":"specs","className":"detail-section","style":{"padding":"80px 0","backgroundColor":"#fff"},"children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"section-title","style":{"textAlign":"center","marginBottom":"50px","fontSize":"3.6rem","fontWeight":700},"children":"Technical Specifications"}],["$","div",null,{"style":{"border":"1px solid #eee","overflowX":"auto"},"children":["$","table",null,{"className":"spec-table","style":{"width":"100%","borderCollapse":"collapse","minWidth":"600px"},"children":[["$","thead",null,{"children":["$","tr",null,{"style":{"background":"#f4f7fa","color":"#333","borderBottom":"2px solid #315ba4"},"children":[["$","th",null,{"style":{"padding":"20px 30px","textAlign":"left","fontSize":"1.6rem","fontWeight":"bold"},"children":"Parameter"}],["$","th",null,{"style":{"padding":"20px 30px","textAlign":"left","fontSize":"1.6rem","fontWeight":"bold"},"children":"Description"}]]}]}],["$","tbody",null,{"children":[["$","tr","0",{"style":{"background":"#fff","borderBottom":"1px solid #eee"},"children":[["$","td",null,{"style":{"padding":"20px 30px","fontWeight":"bold","width":"45%","fontSize":"1.5rem"},"children":"Visible Light"}],["$","td",null,{"style":{"padding":"20px 30px","fontSize":"1.5rem"},"children":"1. Sensor: Back-illuminated ultra-low illumination starlight-grade CMOS\n2. Resolution: 1920×1080\n3. Illumination: Color: 0.0005Lux; B/W: 0.0001Lux; 0Lux (IR ON)\n4. Len